    <h1>About DeJuan Robinson</h1>
    <p>
      DeJuan Robinson is a Strategic Security & Public Safety Executive with 30+ years of
      experience protecting personnel, facilities, and critical infrastructure across federal,
      international, and corporate environments.
    </p>
    <p>
      His career includes senior roles with the U.S. Department of State, Diplomatic Security
      Service, Foreign Affairs Security Training Center, U.S. Immigration & Customs Enforcement,
      and local law enforcement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Global Security Leadership</h2>
    <p>
      DeJuan has led multidisciplinary security teams, managed multimillion-dollar budgets, and
      directed emergency response and crisis operations in high-threat environments such as
      Burkina Faso, Haiti, Libya, Afghanistan, and Guyana.
    </p>
    <p>
      He has served as Regional Security Officer, Assistant Regional Security Officer, Special
      Agent, Senior Law Enforcement Advisor, and Program Manager/Instructor for advanced security
      training.
    </p>
